Subject: retain direct tbl source for bounded semantic enhancement
Upstream-Status: Local embedding (not submitted)

Keep the direct post-comment, pre-expansion source owned by each continued
data cell.  The executed tbl operand remains authoritative; this additional
cell-local fact only permits a bounded consumer to add semantic presentation
without scanning source lines or guessing ownership from visible text.

--- a/roff.c
+++ b/roff.c
